        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Fix CAVLC 4:4:4 Intra Profile hex value in AVC profiles table]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44269</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44269"/>
        <updated>2026-05-27T05:56:16.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161273586?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Corrects the "Number (Hex)" value for CAVLC 4:4:4 Intra Profile in the AVC profiles table on the codecs parameter page from <code class="notranslate">44</code> to <code class="notranslate">2C</code>.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">CAVLC 4:4:4 Intra Profile has H.264 <code class="notranslate">profile_idc = 44</code> in decimal, which is <code class="notranslate">0x2C</code> in hex. The table column header is "Number (Hex)" but the existing value was the decimal form written as if it were hex. Readers using this table to construct or parse a <code class="notranslate">codecs</code> parameter string would otherwise get an incorrect AVC profile byte.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<p dir="auto">Cross-checked against:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>ITU-T H.264 / ISO/IEC 14496-10 (CAVLC 4:4:4 Intra Profile is profile_idc 44)</li>
<li><a href="https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/video/H264" rel="nofollow">IANA media-type registration for video/H264</a> (per the issue)</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">The change is consistent with neighbouring rows in the same table — e.g. High 4:4:4 Predictive Profile (profile_idc 244 = <code class="notranslate">F4</code>) and Scalable High Profile (profile_idc 86 = <code class="notranslate">56</code>) already use the hex form.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #44246.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4517096701" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44246" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/44246/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44246">#44246</a>. Relates to <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4517144174" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44247" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/44247/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44247">#44247</a> (same table, different row — handled in PR <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4529536406" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44268" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/44268/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44268">#44268</a>).</p>]]></content>
