        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/287167749?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h2 dir="auto">Description</h2>
<p dir="auto">This PR fixes an incorrect CC (compatibility constraint) value in the AVC profiles table on the codecs parameter documentation page.</p>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Change:</strong> Scalable High Intra Profile CC value changed from <code class="notranslate">20</code> to <code class="notranslate">10</code>.</p>
