<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #44247.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4517144174" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44247" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/44247/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44247">#44247</a></p>
<hr>
